#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QWidget, ProtectionWidget)
#. +> trunk
#: dialogs/ProtectionWidget.ui:34
msgid ""
"This tab enables you to set Cell Protection. All cells are protected by default (that means cell content cannot be changed) and for the cell protection to be active you also need to protect the sheet using the Tools -> Protect Document -> Protect Sheet... menu and to provide a password.\n"
"You can also hide the cell formula in order to protect the way you calculate the formula. This also needs to enable shet protection to work.\n"
"You can hide the cell content with Hide all and again this needs sheet protection.\n"
"You can learn more about all these settings in the User Manual in the Advanced KSpread chapter."
msgstr ""
"Mit disse Koort lett sik de Zellschuul fastleggen. Standardwies sünd all Zellen schuult (dat bedüüdt, dat sik de Zellinholt nich ännern lett), un dormit de Zellschuul aktiv warrt, mutt de Tabell ok noch mit dat Menü \"Warktüüch -> Dokment schulen -> Tabell schulen...\" mit en Passwoort schuult wesen.\n"
"De Zellformel lett sik ok versteken, dormit sik de Utrekenmetood för de Formel nich rutfinnen lett. Dor mutt de Tabell ok för schuult wesen.\n"
"De Zellinholt lett sik mit de Funkschoon \"All versteken\" ok versteken. Ok dor mutt de Tabell för schuult wesen.\n"
"Binnen den Afsnitt \"Verwiedert\" in't Brukerhandbook vun KSpread lett sik mehr över disse Instellen finnen."

#. i18n: ectx: property (title), widget (QGroupBox, groupBox2)
#. +> trunk
#: dialogs/ProtectionWidget.ui:40
msgid "Printing"
msgstr "Drucken"

#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QCheckBox, m_bDontPrint)
#. +> trunk
#: dialogs/ProtectionWidget.ui:47
msgid ""
"If checked, the content of the cell will not be printed. If this is not checked (default), the cell content will be printed.\n"
"Note that you can print it even if the cell is protected"
msgstr ""
"Wenn dit anmaakt is, warrt de Zellinholt nich druckt. Wenn dit nich anmaakt is (Standard), warrt de Zellinholt druckt.\n"
"Beacht, dat he sik ok drucken lett, wenn de Zell schuult is"

